# North Dakota campaign finance
# The CFRS registry and bulk files carry contributor addresses. Keep both gates
# off by default. A deliberate auto-link or refresh needs the master flag ON
# plus either the refresh flag ON or --force (--force bypasses only the
# refresh gate, never the master flag). The cache-only sync-due needs the
# master flag alone. Raw artifacts live in restricted local storage.
NORTH_DAKOTA_CAMPAIGN_FINANCE_ENABLED=false
NORTH_DAKOTA_CFRS_RAW_DATA_REFRESH_ENABLED=false
NORTH_DAKOTA_CFRS_RAW_DATA_CACHE_DIR=scratch/north-dakota-campaign-finance/cfrs

